(text "RC522: 3.3 V supply and SPI logic. J5 pin 5 (IRQ) is deliberately unused." (at 155 250 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "738fd108-c97c-58a3-b7a4-adeff3eba3e1"))
(text "I2C address plan: PCF8574 = 0x20; OLED typically 0x3C; MPU6050 typically 0x68. Verify modules." (at 155 254 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "e126e84c-cb5a-5e2b-8663-d0d496293df6"))
(text "Remove redundant pull-ups if fitted on external modules; all I2C pull-ups must terminate at 3.3 V." (at 155 258 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "d4e4646d-2d18-582d-a81d-167b4106c970"))
(text "J9 is for a 5 V-input HC-05 carrier with 3.3 V UART levels; series resistors are not level dividers." (at 155 262 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "42669127-5836-5cdb-ac91-1f7a08ca38af"))
(text "J13: 5V DHT11, Q3 bidirectional 3.3V data. J14 ADC <=3.3V. J15 uses PA11/12: unplug core USB." (at 155 266 0) (effects (font (size 0.97 0.97)) (justify left)) (uuid "8399ab0b-0f7f-590f-b0ae-71d9299b730c")))